<title>USA: Atlanta Fed business index -3.3 in Nov vs -8.8 Oct.</title>
<headline>Atlanta Fed business index -3.3 in Nov vs -8.8 Oct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Atlanta said its diffusion index of industry business activity rose to -3.3 in November from a revised -8.8 in October. The production index rose to 7.0 in October from a revised 3.3 in the previous month.</p>
<p>					   November	October revised</p>
<p>Industry Business Index	    - 3.3		  - 8.8</p>
<p>Production Index			 7.0		    3.3</p>
<p>Prices Received			- 7.4		  -11.8</p>
<p>Prices Paid				1.5		    2.5</p>
<p>Backlog of Orders		    - 4.5		  -10.9</p>
<p>New Orders				 4.5		  - 7.0</p>
<p>Shipments				- 3.8		  - 2.2</p>
<p>Number of Employees		  - 0.8		    0.1</p>
<p>Inventories of Finished Goods    - 1.0		    0.6</p>
<p>Materials Inventories		- 5.1		  - 4.9</p>
<p>--N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1562</p>
